<Layout title="Digital delivery — Rakhi Battle 2026" noindex>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <h1>Digital delivery</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 24 August 2026.</p>
    <h2>Free experience</h2>
    <p>The result, free Story poster, Family Court and chain features are delivered on screen as soon as both siblings complete the battle.</p>
    <h2>Paid upgrades</h2>
    <p>After the payment provider confirms a successful payment, the same result page unlocks the purchased digital content. There is no physical shipping. Save the private result link and download your files promptly because festival data is intended to be retained for 45 days.</p>
    <h2>If delivery does not appear</h2>
    <p>First refresh the result page. If a successful debit is still not reflected, use the <a href="/contact">support form</a>, select Payment or delivery, and include the battle code plus payment reference. Do not send card, bank account, UPI PIN or OTP details.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
